msgstr "使用 `quarkus-rest-client-oidc-token-propagation` 和 `quarkus-resteasy-client-oidc-token-propagation` 扩展来传播当前的 `Bearer` 或 `授权码流` 访问令牌。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The access tokens managed by these extensions can be used as HTTP Authorization Bearer tokens to access the remote services."
