#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "tooltip:client['client_credentials' grant requiring an OIDC client authentication only], tooltip:password['password' grant requiring both OIDC client and user ('username' and 'password') authentications], tooltip:code['authorization_code' grant requiring an OIDC client authentication as well as at least 'code' and 'redirect_uri' parameters which must be passed to OidcClient at the token request time.], tooltip:exchange['urn\\:ietf\\:params\\:oauth\\:grant-type\\:token-exchange' grant requiring an OIDC client authentication as well as at least 'subject_token' parameter which must be passed to OidcClient at the token request time.], tooltip:jwt['urn\\:ietf\\:params\\:oauth\\:grant-type\\:jwt-bearer' grant requiring an OIDC client authentication as well as at least an 'assertion' parameter which must be passed to OidcClient at the token request time.], tooltip:refresh['refresh_token' grant requiring an OIDC client authentication and a refresh token. Note, OidcClient supports this grant by default if an access token acquisition response contained a refresh token. However, in some cases, the refresh token is provided out of band, for example, it can be shared between several of the confidential client's services, etc. If 'quarkus.oidc-client.grant-type' is set to 'refresh' then `OidcClient` will only support refreshing the tokens.], tooltip:ciba['urn\\:openid\\:params\\:grant-type\\:ciba' grant requiring an OIDC client authentication as well as 'auth_req_id' parameter which must be passed to OidcClient at the token request time.], tooltip:device['urn\\:ietf\\:params\\:oauth\\:grant-type\\:device_code' grant requiring an OIDC client authentication as well as 'device_code' parameter which must be passed to OidcClient at the token request time.], tooltip:preauthorized-code['urn\\:ietf\\:params\\:oauth\\:grant-type\\:pre-authorized_code' grant requiring an OIDC client authentication as well as at least a 'pre-authorized_code' parameter which must be passed to OidcClient at the token request time.]"
msgstr "tooltip:client['client_credentials' 授权仅需 OIDC 客户端身份验证], tooltip:password['password' 授权需同时进行 OIDC 客户端和用户（'username' 和 'password'）身份验证], tooltip:code['authorization_code' 授权类型，要求进行 OIDC 客户端身份验证，并且至少需要 'code' 和 'redirect_uri' 参数，这些参数必须在令牌请求时传递给 OidcClient。], tooltip:exchange['urn\\:ietf\\:params\\:oauth\\:grant-type\\:token-exchange' 授权类型，需要 OIDC 客户端身份验证，同时至少需要 'subject_token' 参数，该参数必须在请求令牌时传递给 OidcClient。], tooltip:jwt['urn\\:ietf\\:params\\:oauth\\:grant-type\\:jwt-bearer' 授权模式，需要 OIDC 客户端身份验证，并且至少有一个 'assertion' 参数，该参数必须在令牌请求时传递给 OidcClient。], 工具提示：refresh['refresh_token' 授权需要 OIDC 客户端身份验证和一个刷新令牌。请注意，如果访问令牌获取响应中包含刷新令牌，OidcClient 默认支持此授权。 但在某些情况下，刷新令牌是通过带外方式提供的，例如，它可能在多个机密客户端服务之间共享等。如果将 'quarkus.oidc-client.grant-type' 设置为 'refresh'，则 `OidcClient` 将仅支持刷新令牌。], 工具提示：ciba['urn\\:openid\\:params\\:grant-type\\:ciba' 授权类型，该类型不仅需要 OIDC 客户端身份验证，还要求在令牌请求时向 OidcClient 传递 'auth_req_id' 参数。], 工具提示:device['urn\\:ietf\\:params\\:oauth\\:grant-type\\:device_code' 授权方式，需要 OIDC 客户端认证，并且在请求令牌时必须向 OidcClient 传递 'device_code' 参数。], 工具提示：preauthorized-code['urn\\:ietf\\:params\\:oauth\\:grant-type\\:pre-authorized_code' 授权类型，需要 OIDC 客户端身份验证，并且至少需包含一个 'pre-authorized_code' 参数，该参数必须在令牌请求时传递给 OidcClient。]"

